                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>PGvsPI-43 plays a key role in discussions of banking supervision and wider financial regulation at the US Federal Reserve. The interview touches upon the relations between US regulators, global policymaking processes, and developments in the US markets (including desegmentation).</p>"
